# Before-write deny

Factory `.cursor/hooks.json` must include `preToolUse` (failClosed) that denies
writes to protected corporate and factory surfaces unless a live mutation
permit or sealed packet `write_set` covers the path. `afterFileEdit` report-only
does not satisfy ACC-FC-001. Deny names a legal next among
`corp-harness mint-mutation-permit|status|route-model|check` or `halt_report`.
